  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#intersect-the-viewport\r\n\r\n> A video element is said to *intersect the viewport* when it is being rendered and its associated **CSS layout box** intersects the viewport.\r\n\r\nIIUC, an element has [multiple CSS boxes](https://www.w3.org/TR/CSS2/box.html#box-dimensions) (content box, padding box, border box, margin box), so \"[its] CSS layout box\" seems ambiguous. Presumably the sentence should refer to one of those boxes specifically?",
